WEBVTT

00:00:11.898 --> 00:00:13.813
[ neighing]

00:00:13.856 --> 00:00:16.511
[ laughing]

00:00:16.555 --> 00:00:18.078
RON:
Stand back, I said.

00:00:18.121 --> 00:00:21.821
Or I'll-or I'll take it upstairs
if you don't settle.

00:00:21.864 --> 00:00:22.909
NEVILLE:Harry!

00:00:22.952 --> 00:00:24.824
Wherever
did you get it?

00:00:24.867 --> 00:00:26.260
Can I have
a go, Harry?

00:00:26.303 --> 00:00:27.609
After you,
of course.

00:00:27.653 --> 00:00:29.089
What are you
talking about?

00:00:29.132 --> 00:00:30.003
Yeah, quiet!

00:00:30.046 --> 00:00:31.395
Let the man through.

00:00:31.439 --> 00:00:33.006
Uh, I-I didn't mean
to open it, Harry.

00:00:33.049 --> 00:00:34.834
I-I-It, uh,
it was badly wrapped.

00:00:34.877 --> 00:00:36.183
Uh, they
made me do it.

00:00:36.226 --> 00:00:37.924
BOTH:
Did not.

00:00:38.751 --> 00:00:39.882
It's a Firebolt.

00:00:39.926 --> 00:00:42.189
It's the fastest
broom in the world.

00:00:42.232 --> 00:00:43.756
For me?

00:00:43.799 --> 00:00:45.540
But who sent it?

00:00:45.584 --> 00:00:47.063
No one knows.

00:00:47.107 --> 00:00:49.805
This came with it.

00:00:49.849 --> 00:00:51.851
[ indistinct shouting]

00:00:51.894 --> 00:00:53.113
Show us what you can do.

00:00:53.156 --> 00:00:54.244
We're bound to win
the Quidditch cup now.

00:00:54.288 --> 00:00:55.463
Go on, Harry!Yeah, let's see!

00:00:55.507 --> 00:00:56.551
HERMIONE:
How fast is it, Harry?

00:00:56.595 --> 00:00:58.031
Yeah, how fast
does it go?

00:00:58.074 --> 00:00:59.119
RON:
Hang on.

00:00:59.162 --> 00:01:00.033
Wait for me.

00:01:00.076 --> 00:01:01.991
I want
to see this, too.

00:01:02.035 --> 00:01:02.949
[ yelps]

00:01:02.992 --> 00:01:04.298
[ screams]

00:01:04.341 --> 00:01:09.695
[ cheering]

00:01:09.738 --> 00:01:11.740
[ screaming]

00:01:11.784 --> 00:01:14.438
[ laughing]

00:01:17.050 --> 00:01:18.268
HARRY:
Lumos.

00:01:18.312 --> 00:01:21.315
I solemnly swear
that I'm up to no good.

00:01:21.358 --> 00:01:28.148
♪

00:01:37.723 --> 00:01:43.119
♪

00:01:52.694 --> 00:01:58.178
♪

00:02:07.753 --> 00:02:13.236
♪

00:02:22.811 --> 00:02:28.295
♪

00:02:37.826 --> 00:02:43.266
♪

00:02:52.841 --> 00:02:58.325
♪

00:03:07.856 --> 00:03:13.383
♪

00:03:22.915 --> 00:03:28.398
♪

00:03:37.973 --> 00:03:43.457
♪

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:58.515
♪

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:13.574
♪

00:04:23.105 --> 00:04:28.632
♪

00:04:38.164 --> 00:04:43.560
♪

00:04:53.135 --> 00:04:58.619
♪

